   <title>Working with Save Maps</title>
   <prolog>
      <author>Rakesh Singh</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Jul 29, 2022"/>
      </critdates>
      <metadata>
         <prodinfo>
            <prodname>X-Author for Excel</prodname>
         </prodinfo>
      </metadata>
   </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>Use <b>Save Maps</b> to link your environment fields to Excel cells for data that will be saved back to your environment. Save Maps often rely on Display Maps (see <xref href="../working_with_display_maps_98667693/98667693.dita"
               format="dita">Working with Display Maps</xref>). You use <xref href="../save-action_98667688_98667688/98667688.dita" format="dita">Save Actions</xref> in your app to implement Save Maps.</p>
